<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/glossary#maxim-gun">Glossary</a> · Term · weapon</p><h1 class="enc-title">Maxim gun</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Maxim guns</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Maxim gun was the first fully automatic machine gun, invented by Hiram Maxim in the 1880s. It gave European colonial forces overwhelming firepower over African armies. British forces used it in the conquest of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sokoto-caliphate">Sokoto Caliphate</a>, where defenders had no answer to its fire.</p></div>
